[{"category":"section","location":"slots/#Slots","page":"Slots","text":"Data structures similar to a Vector.\n\njulia> using LogicalOperators: AND, OR, XOR, NOT, ∧, ∨, ⊕, ¬\n\njulia> AND(1, 2) == 1 ∧ 2\ntrue\n\njulia> OR{Int}(1, 2, 3) == 1 ∨ 2 ∨ 3\ntrue\n\njulia> NOT(true) == ¬true\ntrue\n\nLaTeX short name unicode operator\n\\wedge ∧ AND\n\\vee ∨ OR\n\\oplus ⊕ XOR\n\\neg ¬ NOT","title":"Slots"},{"category":"type","location":"slots/#LogicalOperators.AND","page":"Slots","text":"struct AND{T} <: AbstractSlot{T}\n    elements::Vector{T} where T\nend\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"LogicalOperators.AND"},{"category":"type","location":"slots/#LogicalOperators.OR","page":"Slots","text":"struct OR{T} <: AbstractSlot{T}\n    elements::Vector{T} where T\nend\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"LogicalOperators.OR"},{"category":"type","location":"slots/#LogicalOperators.XOR","page":"Slots","text":"struct XOR{T} <: AbstractSlot{T}\n    elements::Vector{T} where T\nend\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"LogicalOperators.XOR"},{"category":"type","location":"slots/#LogicalOperators.NOT","page":"Slots","text":"struct NOT{T} <: AbstractSlot{T}\n    elements::Vector{T} where T\nend\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"LogicalOperators.NOT"},{"category":"type","location":"slots/#LogicalOperators.AbstractSlot","page":"Slots","text":"abstract type AbstractSlot{T} end\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"LogicalOperators.AbstractSlot"},{"category":"macro","location":"slots/#LogicalOperators.@add_slot","page":"Slots","text":"macro add_slot(Op::Symbol)\n\n\n\n\n\nmacro add_slot(ops::Symbol...)\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"LogicalOperators.@add_slot"},{"category":"section","location":"logic/#@logic","page":"@logic","text":"To help understanding the bitwise (&, |), short-circuiting booleans (&&, ||).\n\njulia> using LogicalOperators\n\njulia> @logic 4 & 10\n  00000100\n& 00001010\n----------\n  00000000\n0\n\njulia> @logic 4 | 10\n  00000100\n| 00001010\n----------\n  00001110\n14\n\n\njulia-repl julia> x = 3;\n\njulia> @logic x > 1 && x < 10 && x isa Int x > 1 && x < 10 && x isa Int true\n\njulia> @logic x < 1 || x > 10 && x isa Int x < 1 || x > 10 && x isa Int false ```","title":"@logic"},{"category":"macro","location":"logic/#LogicalOperators.@logic","page":"@logic","text":"macro logic(expr::Expr)\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"LogicalOperators.@logic"},{"category":"section","location":"#LogicalOperators.jl","page":"Home","text":"https://github.com/wookay/LogicalOperators.jl","title":"LogicalOperators.jl 🧩"}]
